OL,3,AIndian opposition MPs detained in
OL,4,Aprotest against election chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in Delhi detained several
OL,7,Fopposition lawmakers as they tried to
OL,8,Fmarch demanding the chief election
OL,9,Fcommissioner resign over a
OL,10,Fcontroversial voter roll revision.
OL,12,FMain opposition leader Rahul Gandhi,
OL,13,Fhis sister Priyanka and other MPs were
OL,14,Fforced into a police bus. Released
OL,15,Fshortly after, they resumed their march
OL,16,Fand began a sit-in near Election
OL,17,FCommission headquarters.
OL,19,FIt is the latest escalation in a
OL,20,Fgrowing row over a nationwide revision
OL,21,Fof voter rolls.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
